Yes,

Sorry about the lack of memos.  ;)  OrganismDbi is a new package that 
allows you to make meta packages from annotation packages that implement 
a select() method.  Homo.sapiens is one we made for humans.  It combines 
the human org package, the hg19 txdb known gene package and the GO.db 
package.  The package does not actually "contain" all of that data 
though.  It just retrieves it as requested and returns it to users as if 
there was a single place it was all coming from.

   Marc



