Hi Andrew,

You can also just get your symbols this way:

library(mouse4302.db)
library(org.Mm.eg.db)
select(  mouse4302.db, keys ="1449880_s_at", cols="SYMBOL", 
keytype="PROBEID")

This query will give you a warning because your probe will match to 
multiple symbols, but it avoids the step of having to create a special 
bimap that is set to expose all probes 1st.


   Marc


